  "item": [
    {
      "id": "ef7b9260-d4a8-45c5-9b71-b7851dceb806",
      "name": "Filters",
      "description": {
        "content": "**Filter APIs:** Retrieve available filter values for prospecting.\n\nUse the discovery endpoints to list all available filter types, then fetch valid values for a specific filter type before building a prospecting request.\n\n**Contact filter types:** `departments`, `seniority`, `existingDataPoints`, `countries`, `locations`\n\n**Company filter types:** `names`, `sizes`, `revenues`, `locations`, `sics`, `naics`, `industriesLabels`, `intentTopics`, `technologies`\n",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
      "item": [
